    "howitworks": {
      "type": "ces-card-row",
      "blocks": {
        "card-1": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/6_1.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "title": "80 Tiny Dissolving Cones",
            "text": "<p>Each CEBEAM patch carries 80 microscopic cones made entirely from hyaluronic acid and peptides. Not plastic. Not metal.</p><p>The moment you press them in they start dissolving into your skin, carrying everything with them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "card-2": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/6_2.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "title": "Painless Delivery Beneath The Surface",
            "text": "<p>The cones dissolve beneath the surface, reaching the deeper tissue where eye bags actually form. Not the first layer. Not the second. The layer where the problem lives.</p><p>You feel a light tingle for a few seconds. That's it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "card-3": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/6_3.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "title": "You Sleep. They Work. You Wake Up Different.",
            "text": "<p>While you rest the ingredients release slowly into the deeper tissue over several hours. By morning the work is already done.</p><p>Not sitting on top of your skin waiting to evaporate. Inside it, where it actually counts.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
