    "results": {
      "type": "ces-review-cards",
      "blocks": {
        "review-1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/T1_d8bc01b1-a3c4-4a1a-a74a-720a245c89ca.webp",
            "tag": "",
            "quote": "<p>I had been waking up with eye bags every single morning for 3 years. Tried every caffeine serum, every gel patch, every cold tool I could find. They all worked for about an hour. The first morning I peeled one off the area felt different under my finger. Softer somehow. <strong>Two weeks in and my husband asked if I had slept somewhere more comfortable because I looked so rested. I had not changed anything except these, twice a week.</strong> I cried a little honestly.<br/><br/></p>",
            "name": "–Amanda K. — Chicago, IL",
            "verified": true,
            "rating_tenths": 50
          }
        },
        "review-2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/T2_3424d990-36fd-47ce-9d6e-c938a2f1dc95.webp",
            "tag": "",
            "quote": "<p>I spent close to $600 on eye creams over 2 years. None of them touched the bags. I was starting to research fillers when a friend sent me these. The first morning I peeled one off I could already tell something was different. <strong>Six weeks in and the hollow under my left eye, which has always been the worse one, looks noticeably less deep.</strong> I have not booked the filler consultation. Right now I don't feel like I need to.<br/><br/></p>",
            "name": "–Jennifer R. — Austin, TX",
            "verified": true,
            "rating_tenths": 50
          }
        },
        "review-3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
