            "tag": "",
            "quote": "<p>My phone used to not recognize me for the first hour after I woke up. That sounds funny but it was genuinely embarrassing. <strong>Four weeks in and I walked out of the house one morning without doing a single thing to my under-eye area first. First time that has happened in longer than I can remember.</strong> My coworker asked if I had done something different. I told her I finally found something that works at night instead of in the morning.<br/><br/></p>",
