        "acc-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s Included?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Cebeam dissolving microneedle patches sit under each eye and release concentrated actives through 80 painless micro-cones that dissolve overnight — reaching just below the skin barrier where creams cannot. One fresh two-patch treatment, twice a week during your reset, for visibly fresher, smoother, brighter under-eyes.</p><p><br/><strong>What’s Included</strong></p><p>Every treatment comes in one individually sealed pouch containing two microneedle patches—one patch for each under-eye.</p><h3>21-Day Eye Reset™</h3><p><strong>6 treatments · 6 sealed pouches · 12 patches total</strong></p><p>The complete three-week reset: one treatment on two nights per week, for three weeks.</p><h3>6-Week Eye Rebuild™</h3><p><strong>12 treatments · 12 sealed pouches · 24 patches total</strong></p><p>Six weeks of the same routine, for puffiness and texture that keep coming back: one treatment on two nights per week, for six weeks.</p><h3>9-Week Complete Rebuild™</h3><p><strong>18 treatments · 18 sealed pouches · 36 patches total</strong></p><p>The longest runway, for more persistent bags, dark circles and fine lines: one treatment on two nights per week, for nine weeks.</p><p><strong>1 treatment = 1 sealed pouch = 2 patches (one for each eye), used once.</strong><br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How are these different from eye creams?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>A cream has to fight through the skin’s outer barrier, the layer built to keep things out, so most of it never gets far. The dissolving micro-cones start <strong>below</strong> that barrier and deliver the actives where they can actually work. That’s a delivery difference, not magic.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it actually work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Hydration and a plumping effect are often visible from the very first uses. Deeper changes to dark circles, bags and fine lines typically build over 1–2 weeks of regular use. Consistency — two treatment nights a week — is what matters most.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-4": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who is it for?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Adults dealing with under-eye bags, dark circles, puffiness or fine lines — whether they’re hereditary, from screen time and late nights, or simply from getting older. Gentle enough for men and women with sensitive, mature skin.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-5": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key ingredients",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Hyaluronic Acid</strong> — deep hydration and a plumping effect.</p><p><strong>Niacinamide</strong> — brightens tone and calms the eye area.</p><p><strong>Peptides & Collagen</strong> — support firmness.</p><p><strong>Vitamin C & Retinol</strong> — smooth fine lines and revive radiance.*</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-6": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I apply them?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>On clean, completely dry skin, place one patch under each eye and press firmly for 5–10 seconds. Leave on for at least 2 hours — overnight is best. Remove in the morning and gently press in any residue. Use one fresh treatment twice a week during your reset, and keep to the same two nights a week to maintain.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-7": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do the patches hurt?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>No. You may feel a light tingle for a minute or two as the micro-cones soften and get to work — that fades quickly. Sharp pain isn’t normal; if you feel it, take the patch off.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_VzH6wn": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is redness a sign it worked?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>A little redness is a good sign. Mild temporary redness can occur, and fades quickly.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_DYrk48": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will the patches slide down while I sleep?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><br/>Apply each patch to clean, completely dry skin and press for 5–10 seconds. The placement video shows the fit and the routine we tested. If a patch does not stay in place as shown, contact us so we can help.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_AG9czL": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What should I expect after the first use?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Check how your under-eyes look and feel the next morning, then compare photos taken in the same light as you continue the routine. Hydration and a smoother appearance may be easier to notice early; the degree of change in bags, dark circles, and lines varies with the cause of each concern.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-8": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long before I see full results?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>It depends on how often your under-eye concerns appear and how long you’ve had them. For occasional morning puffiness, the 21-Day Eye Reset gives you three weeks to see how your eyes respond. If puffiness and texture became more noticeable after 40, the 21-Day Eye Reset gives you a consistent three-week routine to assess visible change. If you’ve had stubborn under-eye bags since your twenties, the 9-Week Complete Rebuild gives you a longer runway. Some concerns take more time, and results vary with the cause. Take a photo before you begin and compare it in the same lighting at the end of your routine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer a guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Yes — a 90-day money-back guarantee. If you don’t see a noticeable improvement, contact us for a full refund. You can have opened and used the box.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-10": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping information",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Fast, tracked shipping across the U.S. You’ll get a tracking link by email as soon as your order leaves our facility.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
